# SiCoPR
#
# Short by design. This repository holds code, tests and documentation. Channel
# models, configuration workbooks, reference results and run output live in the
# workspace data/ and runs/ trees, outside every repository. The previous
# version of this file was 243 lines because the old layout kept all of that
# inside the repository and the ignore list had to hold it back. Three of those
# 243 rules still referred to anything that exists here.

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/

# Engine output. Running the engine without a RESULT_DIR writes here.
results/
tests/results.csv

# R writes these beside a rendered report. They are not optional at view time:
# a report without lib/ renders its text and none of its graphs.
**/lib/
.Rhistory
.RData

# Office and editor leftovers
.~lock.*#
~$*
*.tmp

# Machine-local Claude Code state. settings.json IS shared; these are not.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/projects/

# The optional Octave kernels are built per machine (octave/accel/build_accel.py)
# and are tied to one Octave version, so they are never committed.
octave/*.oct
octave/accel/*.o
